        ("Is zero-ETL really free?", "For Aurora and RDS sources AWS charges nothing extra for processing changes, but you pay for source I/O and storage, the initial snapshot export, Redshift compute and storage of the copy. Glue- and DMS-based integrations have their own charges."),
